# Heterogeneous spiking RNNs

## Files

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `snn_core.py` | Core functions shared by the scripts: `dynamics`, `detect`, `evolution`, `initialize_neurons`, `initialize_connectivity_matrix`, `initialize_training`, `currents`. No side effects on import. |
| `run_simulations.py` | Trains networks (several seeds and QIF/LIF proportions) and saves connectivity, inputs and outputs. |
| `run_sweep.py` | Parameter sweep over initial connectivity (`gsyn`) and current amplitudes. |
| `run_average_connectivity_dynamics.py` | Averages the trained connectivity over seeds and runs the dynamics with the averaged matrix. |
| `plot_r2_input_iloop.py` | Tests training quality: computes R² for each parameter combination and shows the inputs in iloop 15 for each seed. |
| `plot_average_connectivity.py` | Tests training quality of the averaged-connectivity dynamics: computes R² for each parameter combination and shows the inputs. |
